<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - East Dagga Q2 pre-tax income falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - East Dagga Q2 pre-tax income falls.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-June versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net income pre tax and debeture interest</p>
<p>8.88    vs    13.09</p>
<p>- Daggafontein plant</p>
<p>    Material treated (tonnes)	3,907    vs    4.288</p>
<p>    gold produced (kg)		   865    vs    1,043</p>
<p>- Withok Dam Material - Ergo plant</p>
<p>    Material treated (tonnes)	1,982    vs    2,126</p>
<p>    gold produced (kg)		   379    vs    382</p>
<p>- 6L13 PGM Project</p>
<p>    Material treated (tones)	 5,504    vs    5,705</p>
<p>    gold produced (troy oz)	 11,056    vs    9,942</p>
<p>Full name: East Daggafontein Mines Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said ther were continuing to evaluate a number of projects that might be suitable for acquisition.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
